  "bodyHash": "f8c331865d6ee693",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>真實火把</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/2517826-realistic-torches\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 論壇</a>&nbsp; - &nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/MattCzyr/RealisticTorches\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">原始碼</a>&nbsp; - &nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/MattCzyr/RealisticTorches/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題追蹤器</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>「真實火把」讓遊戲前期的體驗更具挑戰性，火把會在可設定的時間後熄滅，鼓勵玩家盡早尋找更持久的光源。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18pt\"><strong>功能特色</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>製作出的火把目前為未點燃狀態，必須使用火柴盒或打火石來點亮</li>\n<li>火把會在可設定的時間後熄滅（預設為現實時間 60 分鐘）</li>\n<li>火把遇到雨會被熄滅</li>\n<li>原版建築中自然生成的火把將被替換為未點燃的火把</li>\n<li>可使用螢石製作永久點燃的火把</li>\n<li>原本會自行發光的方塊與物品，手持時也會發光（1.14.4 之前版本）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:x-large\"><strong><strong>合成配方</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/oQWLX8N.png\" alt=\"未點燃的火把（煤炭或木炭）\" width=\"376\" height=\"180\"></p>\n<p><em>未點燃的火把（煤炭或木炭）</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/z0BxMQU.png\" alt=\"火柴盒\" width=\"378\" height=\"181\"></p>\n<p><em>火柴盒</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/2FHuHQi.png\" alt=\"點燃的火把（不需特定排列，火柴盒會受損）\" width=\"379\" height=\"181\"></p>\n<p><em>點燃的火把（不需特定排列，火柴盒會受損）</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tcowSUW.png\" alt=\"螢石水晶（煤炭或木炭）\" width=\"379\" height=\"182\"></em></p>\n<p><em>螢石水晶（煤炭或木炭）</em></p>\n<p><em>&nbsp;</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Nt6fTDz.png\" alt=\"螢石糊（不需特定排列）\" width=\"380\" height=\"213\"></em></p>\n<p><em>螢石糊（不需特定排列）</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vpSV7pX.png\" alt=\"原版火把（螢石水晶）\" width=\"379\" height=\"180\"></em></p>\n<p><em>原版火把（螢石水晶）<br></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/otOc8ue.png\" alt=\"原版火把（螢石糊）\" width=\"381\" height=\"214\"></em></p>\n<p><em><em>原版火把（螢石糊）<br></em></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:18pt\">整合包</span></strong></p>\n<p>可以，您能在您的整合包中使用此模組。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>贊助</strong></span></p>\n<p>如果您喜歡這個模組並希望支持專案，歡迎透過 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fcgi-bin%252fwebscr%253freturn%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f235729%2526cn%253dAdd%2bspecial%2binstructions%2bto%2bthe%2baddon%2bauthor()%2526business%253dmattczyr%2540gmail.com%2526bn%253dPP-DonationsBF%253abtn_donateCC_LG.gif%253aNonHosted%2526cancel_return%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f235729%2526lc%253dUS%2526item_name%253dRealistic%2bTorches%2b(from%2bcurseforge.com)%2526cmd%253d_donations%2526rm%253d1%2526no_shipping%253d1%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" rel=\"nofollow\">PayPal 捐贈頁面</a> 留下您的支持。非常感謝您的贊助！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>贊助商</strong></span></p>\n<p>本專案由 BisectHosting 贊助。如果您正在尋找伺服器主機，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fchaos\" rel=\"nofollow\">請查看他們的方案</a>，並於結帳時使用優惠碼 <em>Chaos</em>，即可享有首月八五折優惠！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fchaos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/0998de1c-6d3e-4370-a553-0da42e986c68.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>",
